{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A charming action adventure where you fight viruses alongside adorable immune cells!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Viruses have invaded the body! As a doctor, you'll control immune cells to fight infections and experience the joy of growing stronger with each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolve into cells with different weapons and abilities every time as you nurture your very own special immune cell. An exciting adventure awaits with these lovable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\uddec Special Fun Elements You Can Experience in Supre-Immune</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/09fe7d21151d7a4c02ce30fcd7131714.avif?t=1751000470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A roguelike action game set in the human immune system! With a structure of fast-paced combat and strategic growth, it offers the joy of new challenges and growth every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/46ccd66dfb00e1aa82edad0cefb38a16.poster.avif?t=1751000470\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/46ccd66dfb00e1aa82edad0cefb38a16.mp4?t=1751000470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/92ac003b2a8b04d60e63965657e9b8d7.avif?t=1751000470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immune cells with round eyes and expressive personalities are waiting for you! With their cute design featuring cell nuclei and cell membranes, you'll find yourself smiling even during intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/fb7bf778e450b63216cf3514c43f8a8d.poster.avif?t=1751000470\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/fb7bf778e450b63216cf3514c43f8a8d.mp4?t=1751000470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/128725b76a894b2a7e60bfdde6436dd3.avif?t=1751000470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No complex controls needed! Anyone can easily enjoy the game with simple movement controls. Since weapons automatically find and attack enemies, you can focus solely on strategic positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/8482630a2009919a7718acb238e14eaa.poster.avif?t=1751000470\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/8482630a2009919a7718acb238e14eaa.mp4?t=1751000470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4adfd2ec0d847bc690d0649fbf9a87a9.avif?t=1751000470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The most exciting moment begins when combat ends! Use collected data to evolve into cells with new weapons and special abilities. Completely different adventures unfold depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/72193960cc60ae9789792c892a8e750f.poster.avif?t=1751000470\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/72193960cc60ae9789792c892a8e750f.mp4?t=1751000470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4234a0423625dd03a3427ca6a9e26fbc.avif?t=1751000470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain experience points every time you evolve, leading to level-ups! With this special system where evolution and growth happen simultaneously, you'll feel the satisfaction of your character getting stronger every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/1e9c989ddee6844989bd58e55acadcc0.poster.avif?t=1751000470\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/1e9c989ddee6844989bd58e55acadcc0.mp4?t=1751000470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/229f644081c5526cf7d438c0670e991f.avif?t=1751000470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The same immune cell can become a close-combat warrior or a long-range attack master depending on your choices. Create your own unique combat style with unimaginable combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4627ead83fe673a2886811bdbc4562a1.poster.avif?t=1751000470\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4627ead83fe673a2886811bdbc4562a1.mp4?t=1751000470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/a0463a47f3970949bd45c014cfeccf49.avif?t=1751000470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's not just ordinary combat! Sudden environmental changes and reliable supply bot appearances create unexpected events that make your adventure even more thrilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/e56a0e2448fb51a8e0c8cd7aa8cb5012.poster.avif?t=1751000470\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/e56a0e2448fb51a8e0c8cd7aa8cb5012.mp4?t=1751000470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/b96914ed8a6fde3e9deaa3e08e7ff929.avif?t=1751000470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of your adventure, massive and powerful bosses await! Elite monsters that appear throughout provide greater challenges and rewards. It's time to show the true power of the immune cell you've grown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/ext