s! With this special system where evolution and growth happen simultaneously, you'll feel the satisfaction of your character getting stronger every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/1e9c989ddee6844989bd58e55acadcc0.poster.avif?t=1751000470\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/1e9c989ddee6844989bd58e55acadcc0.mp4?t=1751000470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/229f644081c5526cf7d438c0670e991f.avif?t=1751000470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The same immune cell can become a close-combat warrior or a long-range attack master depending on your choices. Create your own unique combat style with unimaginable combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4627ead83fe673a2886811bdbc4562a1.poster.avif?t=1751000470\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4627ead83fe673a2886811bdbc4562a1.mp4?t=1751000470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/a0463a47f3970949bd45c014cfeccf49.avif?t=1751000470\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's not just ordinary combat! Sudden environmental changes and reliable supply bot appearances create unexpected events that make your adventure even